files are the right files, and the absence is real. Also, block_turbo2_0's in-source comment still reads '// 10 bytes total' while its static_assert computes 34 - contract section 1.1 warned about exactly those stale comments and it is still stale here. REGISTER DEFECT FLAGGED TO HQ, NOT FIXED HERE: this fork is registered TWICE - as this local_checkouts entry and as the `turboquant` git remote of the engine repo - and the two disagree. The sibling clone src/llama-cpp-turboquant is at a33ef00b1 (2026-06-23) with origin/feature/turboquant-kv-cache at fca3093c9, both OLDER than the remote head this pin now names. One of the two should be authoritative. Full review: research/local-inference/2026-08-17-fork-delta-review.md",
